infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Vendor migration: hard-wired SDK vs OTLP at the edge
  desc Same backend switch — four engineer-weeks of rewrites, or one day of config.
  compares
    - label Vendor SDK hard-wired
      children
        - label Estimate — 4 engineer-weeks
          desc The migration ticket prices in rewriting instrumentation everywhere
        - label Rewrite every service
          desc Proprietary agent (dd-trace, New Relic) is wired into app code
        - label Code change, then redeploy
          desc New vendor means new library imports across the fleet
    - label OTel — OTLP at the edge
      children
        - label Estimate — 1 day
          desc App code calls only the OTel API; nothing in it changes
        - label Edit one Collector YAML block
          desc Swap exporter, endpoint, API key — instrumentation untouched
        - label Redeploy the Collector
          desc Two days later the migration is done, no app code touched
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
